      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yes please! Currently, as it stands, it is possible by duplicating the whole armature and putting the physbone source to the different armatures. Then using rotation constraints to blend between them. This is costly on performance for a number of reasons. Having something like this would be amazing.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
