  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Similar to the weight slider on constraints, I would love a weight slider on the physbone component. The slider would smoothly blend between the rest pose and the current physics simulation. This would allow for easier blending up/down as part of a blend tree, which have become increasingly popular due the performance considerations of animator layers.",
